{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117210","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1011721001:0":{"text":"이 마을은 결국 생기를 되찾지 못했어...","source_cn":"这座村子，还是没能恢复生机……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF783D57A2860754D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011721002:0":{"text":"우리가 이미르를 막지 못했기 때문일까?","source_cn":"是因为我们没能成功阻止伊米尔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBFC9FC0ED9513DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011721003:0":{"text":"이 땅의 생명력은 이미 오래 전에 빼앗겼어요.","source_cn":"这片土地里的生命力，很早以前就已经被夺走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99002864305A875A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011721004:0":{"text":"이미르가 황혼의 나무를 부패시키는 걸 막았다고 해도...","source_cn":"即便我们能成功阻止伊米尔腐化流荧树，恐怕也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF3F6FFC63F0137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011721005:0":{"text":"...다들, 가서 이 모든 걸 구할 방법을 찾아보자.","source_cn":"……诸位，走吧，去想办法挽救这一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF619592413AB7E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_s